Canonical website:
  https://vtk.org/

Canonical download:
  https://www.vtk.org/files/release/9.7/VTK-9.7.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack VTK-9.7.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./VTK-9.7.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/VTK-9.7.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/VTK-9.7.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libVTK9.7_1-9.7.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libVTK9.7-devel-9.7.2-X.tar.xz

